### Integration Details
The Speed Insights component is properly integrated following the official Vercel documentation for Next.js App Router:

**File**: `Client/app/layout.jsx`
- **Line 7**: Import statement: `import { SpeedInsights } from "@vercel/speed-insights/next";`
- **Line 100**: Component placement: `<SpeedInsights />` (inside the `<body>` tag, after main content)

This implementation follows the exact pattern recommended in the official Vercel Speed Insights quickstart guide for Next.js App Router (v13.5+).

